<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux, Audiopar hold 31.43 pct of Havas.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux, Audiopar hold 31.43 pct of Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie Generale des Eaux and investment company Audiopar hold a combined stake of 31.43 percent in French media group Havas, markets regulator Conseil des Marches Financiers (CMF) said on Monday.</p>
<p>CMF said it had been informed that Generale des Eaux held 29.64 percent of Havas while Audiopar held 1.79 percent.</p>
<p>Audiopar is part of the UGC group.</p>
<p>At the same time, French bank Societe Generale reported that it had reduced its Havas holdings to 4.96 percent from five percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
